constraint gpi_fk2_pid_fkey on table gpi_fk2 depends on index gpi_pk_pkey
constraint gpi_pk_parent_fkey on table gpi_pk depends on index gpi_pk_pkey
view gpi_pk_v depends on constraint gpi_pk_pkey on table gpi_pk
HINT:  Use DROP ... CASCADE to drop the dependent objects too.
